Modules to Implement

==================MVP======================================
1. Authentication & Authorization
User Registration (email/password)

Login + JWT Token issuance

Role-based access (e.g., USER, ADMIN)

Password reset (optional)

 2. User Profile
Age, weight, height, gender

Goal: lose/maintain/gain weight

Daily calorie target + macro goals

3. Food Logging
Search food and log meals

Add custom food or recipes

Store timestamp, portion, meal type

Log water intake (optional)
==================MVP======================================
 4. Nutrition Summary
Daily calories + macros chart

Weekly/monthly trends

Remaining calories for the day

 5. Activity Logging (optional)
Log workouts or sync with Apple/Google Fit

Calories burned per activity

 6. Reminders & Streaks
Daily log reminder notifications

Reward streaks for consistency

 7. Admin Food DB Management
Add/modify food entries

Approve user-submitted food

Bulk upload from CSV/API

 8. Reports & Analytics
Charts: calorie intake, macros, weight change

Export to PDF/CSV (optional)

 9. Settings & Preferences
Units (grams/oz, kcal/kJ)

Notification preferences

Dark mode/theme toggle (frontend)
